note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note omega-strand-hub: pure seeded-Omega (om2) zero-JS Helix Strand Exchange & Clip Editor
note Fail-closed OLLMSP01 specialist pack verifier, content-addressed SHA-256 store,
note deterministic OMSPCLIP01 clip composer/validator, HTML UI + JSON/TSV agent APIs.
om2

